{"version":1,"key":"card:630","content":{"id":630,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"学习到两个有用的概念："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"认知过载，人在短时间内接受过量信息从而无法进行有效思考"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"老师快速讲述过多知识点"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"短时间内读完一本书"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"给我带来的启示是不要求在一周或者几周内快速读完一本书，这也与我的实际体验相符，快速读完无法消化书里面的内容，读书更重要的是专注，当读的时间长了，就无法保持专注了，阅读体验及效率大幅降低，学会让自己从中脱离出来，敬酒虽好，可不要贪杯！"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"重复抑制，有效的学习来自于激活神经元，但是重复激活同一神经元，会导致神经元敏度感降低，再次重复时会使得神经元不再被激活，新的连接不再被建立，从而导致无效学习。解决办法："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"间隔复习法，根据某些算法，如  "},{"type":"link","url":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/ZjJ-3MC5MUG9W8MtihPaew","openEdit":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"FSRS 算法 "}]},{"text":" 来设计复习间隔","type":"formatted"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"穿插式学习，同一时间手中有多个项目进行，如阅读多本书，同样是在 3 个月的时间读完三本书，与其一个月依次读完一本，不如穿插式 3 个月交替阅读三本，把战线拉长"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"穿插式学习很符合我的心意，主要反而不是在于把战线拉长，而是如果事情是一件一件的去完成，在完成上一件事情后，我经常拖延不肯开始下一件事情，而同时并行会极大的减少拖延的时间；另外并行的另一个好处是，总有一个项目没有兴趣或存在卡点的情况，可能存在很长一段时间没有进展，如果这个时候有另一个（或几个）项目，就可以切到别的项目，换一换脑子，很有可能过了一段时间对原项目产生了兴趣或者有了思路，人就是这样，喜新厌旧，这样很符合人性"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"参考："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"},{"type":"link","url":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/9_C0p_PLsNViI-UFf8bupQ","openEdit":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"自学的两个大坑：认知过载和理论过载｜学习骇客"}]},{"text":"","type":"formatted"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"},{"type":"link","url":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/JO7z5s_67Ulw8_3Ma6KMdw","openEdit":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"重复抑制——Anki 用户必须知道的现象"}]},{"text":"","type":"formatted"}]}]}]}],"tags":["学习方法"],"createTime":1758725326491,"updateTime":1761991787700,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1761991787700}}